The '''UNL School''' is a series of workshops dedicated to disseminate the knowledge about UNL and the UNL System.<br />
It has been promoted at least three times a year, in difference places of the world, in different levels: from introductory courses to beginners to more advanced courses to those who have been already dealing with the system.

*I UNL School, 4-13 Jun 2003, Mumbai, India
*II UNL School, 18-20 Nov 2004, Yerevan, Armenia
*III UNL School, 21 Feb - 3 Mar 2005, Alexandria, Egypt
*IV UNL School, 4-6 Jul 2005, Florianópolis, Brazil
*V UNL School, 28 Aug - 8 Sep 2005, Geneva, Switzerland
*VI UNL School, 6-10 Mar 2006, Geneva, Switzerland
*VII UNL School, 29-30 Sep 2009, Yerevan, Armenia
